The algorithm implemented by lin_geth_gaslimit.lin is the published
go-ethereum CalcGasLimit / VerifyGaslimit math:

  Upstream: https://github.com/ethereum/go-ethereum
  Tag:      v1.14.12
  Commit:   293a300d64be3d9a1c2cc92c26fcff4089deadcd
  Files:    core/block_validator.go
            consensus/misc/gaslimit.go
            params/protocol_params.go
  License:  GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0

This repository contains an original LIN restatement of that scalar math
with explicit arguments and fail-closed overflow. It is not a copy of the
go-ethereum tree and is not a Geth node.

